--- task
id: t09
dataset: section8
kind: conditional and default values

--- intent
List every person's name, their city or "unknown" when it is missing (as `city`), and "senior" when they are 65 or older, otherwise "active" (as `band`).

--- edition3
query with_city() {
  match { $p: Person }
  return { $p.name, coalesce($p.city, "unknown") as city, if($p.age >= 65, "senior", "active") as band }
}
